  "result": "I fixed all three digest problems; the digest job and service tests pass (69 of 69) and type-checking is clean.\n\n1. **People who never opted in:** the recipient list now includes only people who set at least one kind of notification to digest delivery in that workspace. Before, anyone with any notification setting there counted. The fix is in `src/server/repositories/notification-preference-repository.ts`.\n2. **Busy days:** updates are now sorted newest first before the cap is applied. The digest keeps the most recent updates, and the email's headline is the newest one. The fix is in `src/server/services/digest-service.ts`.\n3. **Archived workspaces:** the digest job now skips archived workspaces, and building a digest for an archived workspace returns nothing. The fixes are in `src/server/jobs/digest-email-job.ts` and `src/server/services/digest-service.ts`.",
